# Spec for tools/riscpkg.py: OpenTTD.
Package: OpenTTD
Section: Games
Priority: Optional
Licence: Free
Maintainer: Andrew Youll <adyoull@users.noreply.github.com>
Standards-Version: 0.4.0
Environment: arm32, vfpv3
Depends: SharedUnixLibrary (>= 1.16), ARMEABISupport
Suggests: OpenTTD-OpenSFX, OpenTTD-OpenMSX
Components: Apps.Games.!OpenTTD (Movable LookAt)
Homepage: https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-openttd
Description: Open-source transport simulation game (OpenTTD 14.1)
 Build road, rail, sea and air networks, with the free OpenGFX
 graphics. Sound effects (OpenTTD-OpenSFX) and music (OpenTTD-OpenMSX)
 are separate packages. ARMv7 with VFP; about 128 MB free.
Build-Map: !OpenTTD -> Apps/Games/!OpenTTD
Build-Untyped: auto
Build-Notice: OpenTTD, packaged for PackMan from the release zip on
 https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-openttd/releases
 .
 OpenTTD 14.1 (www.openttd.org) is under the GNU GPL version 2;
 OpenGFX keeps its own licence. Licences follow.
Build-Copyright: !OpenTTD/docs/COPYING
Build-Copyright: !OpenTTD/docs/OpenGFX-copyright
Build-Copyright: !OpenTTD/docs/PThreadTicker-Licence
